* Decision pattern: scanning and manual entry are represented as distinct, reviewable subgoals.
Goal: Enter an inventory identifier
. Goal: Scan identifier
.. Look at <barcode>
.. Grasp scanner
.. Touch scanner trigger
.. Verify <identifier> is displayed
. Goal: Enter identifier manually
.. Look at <identifier field>
.. Touch <identifier field>
.. Hands to keyboard
.. Type <identifier>
.. Verify <identifier> is displayed
. Goal: Confirm identifier
.. Read <identifier>
.. Verify <identifier> is correct
